      "query": "{\"strategic_intent\": \"Read the blinded candidate predictions, reasoning, retrieval logs, and case snapshot.\", \"summary\": \"I have read the evaluation instructions and schemas, and confirmed the event is a cert-stage petition disposition (scotus/9026000055, denied on 2026-11-09). Three blinded candidates (claude-baseline, codex-baseline, gemini-baseline) are staged under record/blinded/. I will now read the case context, snapshot, and all three candidates' prediction files, reasoning, forecast documents, and",
